# A restart from the in-game menu: as save_load.keys to the in-game menu
# after Quit Scenario in the second battle, then Restart, confirmed. The
# campaign starts over with its pool of random pilots and the pool's count
# as they first were (DS:1B8C and DS:1B8F, the initial copies).
# While the battle runs, a key waits by steps only: polls are the machine's.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000
Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300
Return idle:9000 Return idle:6000                   # leave the editor; the story
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000  # its screens, one key each
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return            # the battle begins
still:2000 @snap:battle                             # its first message up
Return steps:1 Return idle:300 Return idle:300      # on: the leader's commands, Move
PageUp idle:30 PageUp idle:30 PageUp idle:30 PageUp idle:30 PageUp idle:30
PageUp idle:30 PageUp idle:30 Right idle:30 idle:100 # the cursor to (28,49)
Return idle:300 @snap:route Return idle:300 Return idle:300  # the route; accepted; Done
still:2000 @snap:contact Return                     # each message's first choice
still:2000 @snap:won Return
still:2000 @snap:story Return
still:2000 @snap:menu                               # the menu after a won stage
Down idle:50 Down idle:50 Return idle:300 @snap:slots  # Save & Continue
Return idle:300 Return idle:300 Return idle:600 @snap:saved  # slot 1, named, yes
Return idle:6000 Return steps:2 Return still:2000 @snap:second  # the battle; its commands
Up idle:50 Return steps:2                           # Done
Escape idle:300 Down idle:50 Down idle:50 Down idle:50 Down idle:50
Return idle:300 @snap:in_game                       # Quit Scenario
Down idle:50                                        # from Replay Story to Restart
Return idle:300 @snap:confirm                       # Restart; its confirmation up
Return idle:600 @snap:restarted                     # yes
